OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredibly rare' whale sighting
OL,4,Araises concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA whale which "shouldn't be anywhere
OL,7,Fnear our coast" has been spotted during
OL,8,Fa wildlife cruise.
OL,10,FA Facebook post from the Mevagissey to
OL,11,FFowey Ferry said people on a boat off
OL,12,Fthe Cornish coast saw a Sowerby's
OL,13,Fbeaked whale.
OL,15,FSowerby's beaked whales, which can grow
OL,16,Fup to 18ft (5.5m) in length, are
OL,17,Fpredominately found in the eastern area
OL,18,Fof the North Atlantic and are "seldom
OL,19,Fseen at sea" as they dive down deep,
OL,20,Fthe Whale and Dolphin Conservation
OL,21,Fcharity said.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
