OL,3,GNEWSA'Incredibly rare' whale sighting
OL,4,Araises concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Jarvis, from British Divers Marine
OL,7,FLife Rescue, said it was "incredibly
OL,8,Frare" to have a sighting so close to
OL,9,Fthe coast and the animal might be in
OL,10,Ftrouble.
